This representation truly helped me shape a vision of design procedures that's simple – yet clear, scalable and efficient – and that works particularly well in conjunction with each phase of UX design (Strategy, Scope, Structure, Skeleton, Surface).

For me, the Double Diamond is a constant reminder of when to&nbsp;expand as widely as possible&nbsp;and when to&nbsp;converge with precision. Because of this, I’ll also use it as a guide throughout this case study. Let's dive into it.
